Judge whether this build record shows a recreation ready to be scored, or one whose defects are already visible in its own paperwork. Price: (1) PARAMETERIZATION — is the piece genuinely CONFIG-driven (fields named, ranges sane), or hard-coded with a config costume? (2) PURITY PRE-CHECK — does the construction route describe generation from parameters, with no tracing/embedding step hiding in the prose? (3) OWN-CHECKS COMPLETENESS — are the mechanical guards' results recorded (purity grep, swap test, syntax), or asserted? Census-checkpoint mapping (Amendment A11): every Observe census checkpoint for the item must map to an executable own-check assertion whose evaluation instant is CONFIG-derived; the build-record identifies checkpoint · assertion · CONFIG expression · evaluated result. ASSERTED-CHECKS is returned if any checkpoint lacks this mapping, any evaluation instant uses hardcoded defaults, or execution evidence is absent; a CONFIG timing swap must be shown to move the corresponding assertion's evaluation instant. Receipt form (Amendment A12): the execution evidence for each assertion is its EXECUTABLE RECEIPT — harness command or run · CONFIG expression evaluated · raw result from the build under review (for a timing swap, the receipt shows the changed evaluation instant); a claim without its receipt is execution evidence absent. Receipt-index ground (Amendment A13): a build-record whose RECEIPT INDEX is missing an expected entry (an applicable guards.md command, a planned A11 assertion, an assertion inherited whole from a prior attempt's filed harness, or a census row for an expected CONFIG key), carries an exclusion whose disposition cites no governing plan or guard, or carries a populated receipt lacking the evidence its assertion requires (CONFIG expression + evaluated value for CONFIG-derived inputs; raw observed result for checks) is an ASSERTED-CHECKS ground by name. The same leg prices the A6 fit evidence: a fit-table row lacking measurement provenance, or carrying model-derived bounds, per guard-measured-fit.md checks 1-2 is an ASSERTED-CHECKS ground. (4) TECHNIQUE FIDELITY PLAN — does the record state which packet mechanics the build implements and which it deliberately defers (a deferral named is lawful; a mechanic silently absent is not)? Score 0-1 per dimension (parameterization · purity pre-check · own-checks completeness · fidelity-plan honesty), classify defects (primary taxonomy: HARDCODED-CONFIG · TRACING-STEP · ASSERTED-CHECKS · SILENT-DEFERRAL). Verdict classes: FIRE-WAVE · HOLD. Any dimension < 0.5 → HOLD; ASSERTED-CHECKS at any score → HOLD. You judge paperwork only.

